WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The general losses in the hotel have all left from today

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:05,040
I'm going to build this place into a long-term stronghold

3
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,840
Those who stay will be given shelter

4
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:08,800
Materials and protection corresponding

5
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:11,040
Everyone must register and be able to assume the position

6
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,120
Do not harm your companions

7
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,360
Not to mention betraying the stronghold

8
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:14,960
Why do you guarantee safety?

9
00:00:16,590 --> 00:00:18,670
Those who don’t want to stay can leave now

10
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:21,030
I'll make sure you leave this area safely.

11
00:00:21,850 --> 00:00:23,330
Can I come back after I leave?

12
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:24,810
I guarantee you will leave safely

13
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:29,690
There is no guarantee that you will be able to come back safely. The door is already open. Go ahead and make your own choice.

14
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,040
last confirmed

15
00:00:42,810 --> 00:00:45,130
If you stay, you must abide by the rules here.
